  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "drowzeys' two-Spark launch of the stock deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-DSpark checkpoint (MIT, ungated, 167 GB) with DSpark speculative decoding (k=5), an experimental nvfp4_ds_mla 4-bit KV cache and a 1,500,000-token window, TP=2 over RoCE/IB. Defaults follow upstream's standing profile: 12 sequences, GPU memory 0.85, 8192 batched tokens, B12X MoE and B12X WO projection, prefix caching, thinking off, temperature 0. Upstream reports (not measured here) a 3.23M-token KV pool, C1 about 51 tok/s, C12 about 255 tok/s aggregate, 61 to 67 percent DSpark acceptance and needle recall to 543,994 tokens. The runtime is drowzeys' published stage-c image (aidendle94 GB10 base plus Rafael Caricio's DSpark overlay plus tonyd2wild's nvfp4 stages); upstream's launcher names it vllm-dspark-runtime:dspark-nvfp4-stage-c and this recipe pins ghcr.io/drowzeys/vllm-dspark-nvfp4-stage-c:gb10 (2026-07-01), which drowzeys' companion repo documents as that image. Upstream's ghcr.io/drowzeys/dspark-nvfp4-stage-c is not publicly pullable. Licences: repo Apache-2.0, checkpoint MIT. Not gated.",
    "tags": [
      "candidate",
      "dspark",
      "executable",
      "deepseek",
      "dual",
      "mtp",
      "nvfp4-kv",
      "reasoning",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "vllm"
    ],
    "title": "DeepSeek V4 Flash DSpark NVFP4-KV 1.5M vLLM two Sparks (drowzeys)"
